# Docker build context for the Blender Lambda image.
#
# The context is this directory (backend/lambda/) so that the Dockerfile can
# COPY shared/ directly. That would otherwise also ship the four zip functions,
# so exclude everything and re-include only what the image needs.
*
!shared/
!functions/blender-render/

# Never ship caches or local build output, even from the included paths.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
